Compute NVIDIA GPU power from the energy counter

Since the 570 drivers, NVIDIA's 32-bit NVML returns NVML_SUCCESS with
garbage from nvmlDeviceGetPowerUsage, so 32-bit games show millions of
watts. nvmlDeviceGetTotalEnergyConsumption (documented, Volta and newer)
is still correct there, and power is its rate of change. Falls back to
nvmlDeviceGetPowerUsage without an energy counter, and checks return codes.

Upstream: https://github.com/flightlessmango/MangoHud/issues/1607

diff --git a/src/loaders/loader_nvml.cpp b/src/loaders/loader_nvml.cpp
